# {{.Name}}

Download module dependencies, test, build, and run from this directory:

```sh
go mod download
go test ./...
go build ./cmd/http
go run ./cmd/http
```

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/readyz returns `ready`. Configure the address with HTTP_ADDR; .env.example documents the variable and is not automatically loaded.

The HTTP adapter calls application readiness. Domain and ports locations are intentionally empty until business requirements exist. No business behavior or persistence is implemented.
